Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.57,0:00:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，敞开心扉迎接你们的追求者，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, open your hearts to your suitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯·贝克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius Beck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:06.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘，他是电视台总裁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shh. Network president.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是橄榄球界的黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's football black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这个丑闻怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What about this scandal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他骂那个记者是婊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He called that reporter a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，别闹了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？你到底来这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet? But what the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来夺回我的王国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking my kingdom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我一直这么跟着你转，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I keep following you around like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剧组的人会很难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the crew's gonna have a really hard time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我才是制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}believing I'm the showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要带我们躲过这场灾难，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just got to steer us past this train wreck,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我就把节目还给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then I will hand the show back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里谁说了算？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我。  -我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am.   -I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的两个老板，他们在做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My two bosses, they're making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个不同版本的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}two different versions of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们在片场我没法做节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't produce it with them on the set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋想让我让她一个人全权负责节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel wanted me to let her run the show all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以科尔曼才在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why Coleman's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不需要奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你我联手，我们能做出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Between you and me, we can make shows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正有意义的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that actually mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来是你叫我“性感瑞秋”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're the one who's calling me "Hot Rachel."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你确实有点像她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you do kind of look like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我法官对抚养权怎么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what the judge said about the custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我点好消息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a little good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能谈一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we talk for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你满嘴谎言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lied about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，布兰迪。我们完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, Brandi. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:55.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯，我是瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, it's Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把门关上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，有人看到我的快递员吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, has anybody seen my messenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没有，老大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing yet, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:06.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，一到就立刻告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great, can you please just let me know the second it arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:07.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我昨天就要用了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need it, like, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到这些东西了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:12.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特管事的时候订的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet ordered them when he was still in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是什么东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，是女子橄榄球约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello? Powder-puff football date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:16.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这应该是女生的队服，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's supposed to be the girls' uniforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:19.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但肯定会像在拍黄片，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's definitely gonna look like a porn shoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.15,0:01:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且今天片场还有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and there's a reporter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《娱乐周刊》的记者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from Entertainment Weekly on set today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以就我一个觉得有问题？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's just me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的女权主义神经没被这些东西冒犯到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your feminist sensibilities aren't offended by these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。今天没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希拉里会怎么说，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What would Hillary say, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真不敢相信你还在开那辆车。  -为什么不行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can't believe you're still driving that thing.   -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你想开一圈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you want to take it for a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还在等机会把它开足马力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm still waiting to open her up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:55.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看它能跑多快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}see how fast she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，你真想看奎恩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, do you actually want to watch Quinn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成娜奥米·坎贝尔吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}turn into Naomi Campbell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她真的会把我揍个半死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because she's seriously gonna beat the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已经不需要她了。记下了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've outgrown her. Note taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了，《娱乐周刊》的人来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Entertainment Weekly's here, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去给他们调些片段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go pull some clips for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:11.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五分钟后里面见？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meet me inside in five?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹，快递员到了告诉我好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dan, can you please let me know when the messenger arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到，老大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你带了葡萄干麦片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I brought you Raisin Bran
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面没有葡萄干，还有……怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without any raisins in it and... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你带了没葡萄干的葡萄干麦片\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I brought you Raisin Bran without the raisins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和没有幸运符的幸运星麦片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Lucky Charms without the charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没让你带啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I didn't ask for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我只是想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I-I just thought
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你会需要或者想吃。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}maybe you would need it or want it. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:46.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，你是不是有话要说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, are you trying to say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:47.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就直说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then just speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，你一直不接电话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you weren't answering your phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就开始打制片办公室的电话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so they started calling the production office
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说了你爸爸的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and said about y-your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。我晚点再处理他的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Christ. I'll deal with him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:08.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:11.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:32.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:33.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么……为什么这儿有个婴儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why... Why is there a baby here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天是“带宝宝上班日”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's bring your baby to work day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，你是把辛西娅给杀了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, did you, like, kill Cynthia or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我没杀我前妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't kill my ex-wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没杀她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她去参加迪帕克·乔普拉的静修了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's at a Deepak Chopra retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给保姆放了一天假。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gave the nanny the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:44.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该来点肌肤相亲的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was time for some skin-to-skin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}气味交流时间了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}pheromonal bonding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为有那什么，就是那种\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought that there was this whole, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}争夺抚养权的官司，你输了啊。没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}legal custody battle thing, which you lost. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法律个屁。不，这是我的DNA。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Legal schmegal. No, this is my DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:54.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我在世上的传承，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my legacy on Earth, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我倒想看看哪个法官能把它从我这儿抢走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like to see some judge try and take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非先拔光我的牙、化掉我的骨头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd have to pull my teeth and melt my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你能不能就把孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, can you please just keep the baby
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带离那些女孩远点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}away from the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对她们来说就像猫薄荷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like lady catnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，你干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因永远都会记得我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn's always gonna remember me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:12.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是那个给她未婚夫口交的女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as the girl who went down on her fiancé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还告诉她她爸死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and told her that her dad was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因的爸爸死了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn's dad died?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她才刚开始喜欢我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she was just starting to like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没有，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She wasn't, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:43.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，就是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想过来跟你说声抱歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to come by and say that I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为你……你爸爸的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that your... That your dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你抱歉的是这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's what you're sorry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是盖瑞的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not Gary?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，现在不是时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, now's not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，正是时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，最合适的时机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, actually, the perfect time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你去电视台之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would've been before you went to the network,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在也凑合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but now will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟盖瑞谈过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a conversation with Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是你把制作人的职位给了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just that you gave me the showrunner job
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后又基本上收走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and essentially took it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你背后捅我一刀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you stabbed me in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我去找盖瑞谈，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I went to talk to Gary,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个能保持客观的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}somebody who could be objective,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个讲道理、冷静的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}somebody that could be reasonable and cool headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}背后捅我一刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stabbed me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，不是，我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, no, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我只是想为节目做最好的选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I was just trying to do what's best for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，胡说八道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, that's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是抢权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a power grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少有点种承认。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least have the balls to own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:44.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是慌了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just freaked out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们的节目要完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because our show was going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你这一慌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, your little freakout
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才让那个小屁孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is the reason why that pre-teen dirt bag
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开着跑车到处转\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is driving around a sports car
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车上还印着我节目的名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with the name of my show on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们根本不会派他来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They would've never sent him in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你没去跟校长打小报告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you didn't tattletale to the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们只能忍受他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now we're stuck with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，走开吧，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, just go away, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有新老板了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a new boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别装得好像你在乎我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop acting like you care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在乎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你表达的方式可真特别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a funny way of showing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:22.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我从一无所有里把你捞出来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I plucked you from nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你当上制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}made you a producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你以为你能单干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now you think you can just do this all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为事实是，你需要我在你身后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause the truth is, you need me behind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}指引你、推着你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}guiding you, pushing you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撑着你，不让你崩溃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}propping you up so you don't crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你总是会崩溃，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you'll always crack, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不稳定，还不知感恩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're unstable and ungrateful,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有我，你根本做不了这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you cannot make this show without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你的快递到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, your delivery's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让人直接送到这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have you come right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可算来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:16.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧，你能就停在那儿别动吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what, can you just freeze right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:22.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你时间不多，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have much time, so
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴见到你，医生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good to see you, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也很高兴见到你，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good to see you, too, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她知道。没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She knows. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的伤只要向媒体走漏一个字，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One word about his injury gets out to the press,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的职业生涯就完了。好吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and his career's over. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在想什么，D？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell were you thinking, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不带她，医生怎么进来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How else was the doc gonna get in without her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:54.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天《永恒》节目里是软式橄榄球。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today on "Everlasting," it is powder-puff football.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们将分粉队和蓝队上场拼杀，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ladies will hit the turf in their pinks versus blues,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯会穿好装备，替两边都打四分卫，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Darius is suiting up to play quarterback on both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但赌注很高\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the stakes are high
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为获胜的队伍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because the winning team
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能跟我们的王子赢得约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gets that winning date with our prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请女士们上场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cue the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边走，女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go this way, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这太荒唐了。  -是啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is ridiculous.   -Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说，我们浪漫的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, where's our romantic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}环绕火山的直升机之旅呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}helicopter ride around a volcano?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，我们又穿着内衣了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And besides, we're kind of in our underwear again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:27.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长得像我这样就没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Works out fine when you look like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，达里乌斯到底在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, where the hell is Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这儿一院子发情的直女\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got a field full of horny straight girls here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而格雷厄姆是唯一能看到的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Graham is the only dick in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情况很不妙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not a good situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人玩得开心，瑞秋。他在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one is having fun, Rachel. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，他会尽快赶过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, he'll be there as soon as he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}情况很糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一拖再拖，现在更严重了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You put this off, and it's gotten worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能先给他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, can you just, like, give him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开点止痛药，就现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something for the pain for right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他需要那疼痛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He needs the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来提醒他什么时候伤到了自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to tell him when he's done damage to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是时候了，D。你需要手术。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time, D. You need surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我们谈过这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那手术要18个月恢复期\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That surgery has an 18-month recovery time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还不保证一定有效。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and no guarantee it'll actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的职业生涯可能就此完蛋，你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My career could be over, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}D，你不做手术，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}D, you don't get the surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的职业生涯就肯定完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and your career is definitely over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这样没法打球，我们也瞒不下去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't play like this, and we can't hide it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们一直瞒着我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were you guys hiding this from me the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以刚才……我是说，你早就知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what just... I mean, you knew about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是你来的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟“少来这套”一点关系都没有，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It has nothing to do with "Bitch, please," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我本来能靠打球摆脱那些破事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I could've played my way out of that nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我没受伤的话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I wasn't injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现实是，我还是得洗白形象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but as it is, I still need to clean up my image
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有……敲定那份体育解说合同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and... and lock down that sportscasting deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is right, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你才需要留在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is why you need to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一次撞错……哪怕探戈跳错一步，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One wrong hit... Hell, one wrong tango step,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:33.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}椎间盘就可能裂开让他瘫痪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that disc could fissure and paralyze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了医生，那不会发生的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, doc, that's not gonna happen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本没在打球，所以不会发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not even playing, so that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有……你不……你没听进去，D。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no... You're not... you're not hearing me, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢来，别急。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy, easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我说了算，我就用胶带把你绑在担架上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If it was my call, I'd duct tape you to a gurney
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就救护车把你拉走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and haul you out of here in an ambulance right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目有足够的素材让你好看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show has enough footage to make you look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就说是你背部受伤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We spin it so you tweaked your back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了救一个溺水的女孩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}saving some girl from drowning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.07,0:10:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以得离开去做理疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you have to leave to do some physical therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不知道自己在说什么，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't know what he's talking about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的素材根本差得远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't even have close to enough footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:06.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就约了几次会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have gone on a couple of dates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概亲了两个女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and kissed, like, two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，他要走了。这节目不值得……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, he's leaving. This show is not worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道片场有个记者吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know that there's a reporter on set?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果这记者哪怕觉得有问题……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if this reporter even thinks that there is a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说得有道理。住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got a point. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:20.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你一天，但我们今晚就走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got the day, but we're out of here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，太蠢了。我不干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that's stupid. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让达里乌斯离开球场……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want Darius off the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟蒂芙尼做解说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh-mnh... doing a play-by-play with Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？找个职业球员来有什么意义\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? What is the point of casting a pro football player
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们根本看不到他打球，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if we're never gonna actually watch him play football, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼是你的好姐妹。你该高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany is your wifey. You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会给她一个闪光的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna give her an opportunity to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么就看不出来？你真好心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you not see that? That's so sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是傻子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}照做就是了。行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just do it. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 嘿，我知道你害怕，但没关系 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Hey, I know you're scared, but that's all right *
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:11:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 当你在这荒野中生活 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* When you're living out here in the wild *
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 嘿，准备好活下去 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Hey, just be prepared to stay alive *
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 当你在这野外生活 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* When you're living out here in the *
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 在这荒野中生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Living out here in the wild
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是科尔曼吧？嗯？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're Coleman, right? Hmm? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你是制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:18.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做这样的节目一定责任重大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Must be a huge job getting a show like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撞衫了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twinsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嗨。你坐了我的位子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hi. You're in my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。哦。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Oh. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头聊。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk later. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的记者来了。他正要出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our reporter's here. He's on his way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯怎么耽搁了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the hold up with Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，没事。完全没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, nothing. It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不玩这种高中生的把戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't play this high school crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:44.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你告诉我实话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You tell me the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们作为团队一起合作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then we work together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这真是胡扯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this is some bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:02.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少他们一直给我们酒喝。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least they keep giving us drinks. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们真是喝得猛啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys are really slugging 'em back, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。能再给我们来一杯吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Yeah, can you bring us another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第四杯？好的。没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Number four? Okay. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:09.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会很有趣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:10.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，我本来是要当医生的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, I was gonna be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:20.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我们真的很想让大家出去嗨，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, so, we really want to get everyone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玩得开心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就没人觉得这样有问题吗？只有我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, no one else has a problem with this? Just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我猜其他姑娘就是比较会玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I guess the other girls are just a little more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得放松一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to loosen up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:36.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}液体快乐，就在你手心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Liquid fun. Palm of your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你想怎么做都行，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I mean, you can do what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但达赖厄斯说如果你今天不卖力，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Darius says he's gonna cut you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就要裁掉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you don't bring it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗密欧想尽快把达赖厄斯弄走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Romeo wants to get Darius out of here A.S.A.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达赖厄斯想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does Darius want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还在犹豫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's kind of on the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:13.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生说他要……不过，那是好事啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The doctor's saying that he... Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，医生说他需要做手术，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, no, the doctor's saying that he needs to have surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且昨天就该做了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有谁能让我们联系吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have anyone that we could call?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}秘密请到这里来给个第二意见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just discretely bring in here for a second opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个朋友是运动医学的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a buddy in sports medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他专门帮球员留在赛场上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's made a career of keeping players in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给他打电话，我现在就打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will call him. I will call him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:31.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说了兰迪的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard about Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？哦，那是我的后代。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm? Oh, that's my progeny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是威尔顿家族的未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the future of the Wilton line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想抱抱他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want to hold him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那团鬼哭狼嚎的肉，就是你背着我和老婆乱搞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That caterwauling ball of flesh is the result
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞出来的结果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of you cheating on me with your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:59.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是从她阴道里出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It came out of her vagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，不，我不想抱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So no, I don't want to hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真让人看清一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really puts things in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:04.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的，生命的轮回什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the whole circle of life thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你养孩子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you raise kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你会的一切都教给他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}teach them everything you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他们长大就捅你一刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then they grow up to stab you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在就想拿个枕头捂死他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd put a pillow over its face right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还小，可以推说是婴儿猝死症。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still young enough to claim SIDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:20.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.93,0:14:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因，是我，杰伊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, it's Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因，跟我说说兰迪的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn. Talk to me about Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.10,0:14:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个没用的父亲，现在他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was a worthless father, and now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:34.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:36.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在进步，切特，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm developing, Chet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这些五颜六色的便利贴还看不出来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you tell by all my colorful Post-it notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你认输了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的，我想把节目拿回来的时候，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, when I wanted the show back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拼了命地跟我争，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you fought me tooth and nail,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在节目落到一个小怪人和一个蠢货手里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but now that it's a little weirdo and dick for brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就这么拱手让给他们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're just gonna hand it over to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目是我们的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show is our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得为它争取。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎因，你知道瑞秋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Quinn, did you know that Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.66,0:15:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，呃，那是真婴儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, ew, is that a real baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要什么，杰伊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you need, Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋和科尔曼鬼鬼祟祟的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel and Coleman are acting real shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:06.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们让达赖厄斯站在场边，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've got Darius standing on the sidelines
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿着整套西装，活像个黑人版的皮威·赫尔曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wearing a full suit looking like a black Pee-Wee Herman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿西装怎么打球？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's he gonna play in a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这就是我的意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋让他去做解说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's got him commentating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么能把那个催眠大会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How am I supposed to turn that snore-a-thon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成电视节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into a TV show?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我会想出办法的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I will figure it out, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达赖厄斯到底怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is going on with Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:34.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.17,0:15:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那人是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个送信的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停，停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是送信的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达赖厄斯受伤了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius is hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他今天没上场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why he's not on the field today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……那是大新闻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's... that's big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能影响他的职业生涯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could affect his career.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把他受伤的事播出去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We show that he's hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是我们的故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们用直升机把他送医，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We medevac him in a helicopter,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女孩们哭天喊地，警笛大作，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}girls crying, sirens blaring,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了谁能陪他去医院而大打出手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}catfighting over who gets to ride with him to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那种拉高收视率、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just your general ratings-spiking,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能做成宣传片的电视黄金素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}promo-making television gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果节目砸了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if the show tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也是在科尔曼任内发生的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it did happen on Coleman's watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。科尔曼出局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly. Coleman's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:16.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会回来找我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They come back to me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为打造了这档节目14季的天才，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as the genius who's made the show for the last 14 seasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们再选个新的追求者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then we just pick a new suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，方下巴、中西部那种类型。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, square jaw, midwestern type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就能重新开播了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're back on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要怎么做才能实现？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do we have to do to make this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:33.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让Darius上场，然后把他放倒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We get Darius on the field, and we take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，计划有变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Change of plans, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像Darius这种级别的四分卫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A quarterback of Darius' caliber
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:46.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得能在最后一秒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}needs to be able to switch up a play
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说变就变，临时改战术，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just like that at the very last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而他今天就是这么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that is exactly what he has done here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看，Darius需要更开阔地看清他的阵容，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, Darius needs a wider view of his lineups,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既在解说席上解说今天的球赛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}both in the booth calling today's football game
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身边还有职业橄榄球公主Tiffany James。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}alongside pro football princess Tiffany James.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，她确实够专业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she's a pro all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}公主个鬼。我可是有真皇冠的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Princess my foot. I actually have tiaras.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们自己上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girls are on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，先得分的那队\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First team to score, remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能获得和我们的王子共进晚餐的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gets the coveted dinner date with our prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去拿下他吧，姑娘们。祝好运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go get 'em, ladies. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他女孩会恨死我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other girls are gonna hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他女孩？她们早就恨你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These other girls? These other girls already hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你金发又有钱。管她们干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're blonde and rich. Who cares about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重点是让你和Darius并肩坐在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is about you and Darius sitting side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道他会了解到你什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what he's gonna know about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会看到你是个完美的组合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna see that you are the total package.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会爱上你的。我现在就看出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna love you. I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你朋友有消息吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Did you hear from your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-还在手术。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Still in surgery.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。有他消息告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Let me know when you hear from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去处理Romeo。还得处理这家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to deal with Romeo. I got to deal with this guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Dominick？嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dominick? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。Coleman Wasserman。幸会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Coleman Wasserman. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:46.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸会的是我。我是这儿的新制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pleasure's mine. I'm the new showrunner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你们接待。哦，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks for having us. Oh, of course.
