Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人答应过要跟你打球，达里厄斯·贝克，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was promised a game with you, Darius Beck,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打算来兑现。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I intend to collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会是害怕跟几个女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not scared of playing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一起打球吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a few girls, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就来打吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Then let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，那就打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let's play then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.65,0:22:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:07.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们，姑娘们，好了。该我上场了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, ladies, okay. I'm up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿，达里厄斯。  -说吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, Darius.   -Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我挺好。你们在场上的样子真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good. You girls look good out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:12.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-西装不错。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's a nice suit.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.67,0:22:17.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得不该穿西装打橄榄球。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I should not play football in a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们大概该把它脱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should probably take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。搞什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赢了！我赢了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧，达里厄斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay, Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你没事吧？  -达里厄斯，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you okay?   -Darius, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来人。我们马上找人帮你，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help. We'll get you some help right now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋。哦。真是难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel. Oh. This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟。我跟我朋友谈过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oy vey. I talked to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实有个办法。风险极大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We do have an option. It's incredibly risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.62,0:23:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的救护车到底在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where the hell is my ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.46,0:23:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因，他们说已经在路上了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, Quinn, they said they were on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我们喊狼来了太多次了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we've cried wolf so many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.79,0:23:14.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们根本不信我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know they never believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.63,0:23:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就再打一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, call them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.86,0:23:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈？这太棒了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh? This is fantastic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他被送去医院，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, he gets taken away to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们痛哭，床边守候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}girls weeping, bedside vigils.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再塞几个性感护士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We throw in some sexy nurses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直就是《永恒医生》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like "Everlasting M.D."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:33.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因，这情况挺严重的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, this is, like, a serious situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:35.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能……不能这样毁了他的人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't... you can't do that to his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他受伤了。你会毁了他的职业生涯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's hurt. You're gonna wreck his career.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.75,0:23:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟。真是可怜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aww. That's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:40.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会反噬到你头上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna blow back on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.79,0:23:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然你没把他调查清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly you didn't vet him properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是职业橄榄球运动员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a professional football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:46.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得连他的球队都没发现的问题，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think that if his team couldn't catch it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能发现？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we could've?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:50.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但法律上，你有责任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But legally, you're culpable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。让我猜猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Oh, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:54.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电视台答应过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, the network promised
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会支持你的构想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that they would support your vision
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:23:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你签约，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and put you on a deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.97,0:23:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你想开发什么都可以，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and said you could develop whatever you wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.91,0:24:02.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你像只老鼠一样扑了上去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you jumped on it like the rodent that you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而他们只求了你一件小小的忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they asked for one teeny, tinesy little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》是棵摇钱树，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"'Everlasting' is a cash cow,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.25,0:24:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但现在有点一塌糊涂，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but right now, it's a bit of a train wreck,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.08,0:24:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们只是想知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so we were just wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能不能进去帮忙稍微修补一下？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you could go in and maybe fix it up a little"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.82,0:24:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。事情是这样的，小男孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Well, here's the dealio, boy-chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:20.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，再过几分钟，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, in a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的明星就要跳上救护车，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your star is going to be jumping in an ambulance,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.93,0:24:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后被送走，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he's going to get taken away,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.83,0:24:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这季就完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and your season is screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.54,0:24:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以怪我，也可以怪切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you can blame me, you can blame Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你甚至可以怪圣诞老人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you can even blame Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.54,0:24:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但电视台不在乎，因为他们只知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the network doesn't care because all the network knows
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.98,0:24:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是他们让你负责的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is that they put you in charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.55,0:24:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这一切都发生在你眼皮底下，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and all of this happened on your watch
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为，呃，你是制作人，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because, uh, you're the showrunner, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你能把自己从这个坑里挖出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck digging yourself out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:53.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去引开罗密欧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll distract Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.87,0:25:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}D，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}D, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好过。这点毫无疑问。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been better. That's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那接下来会更糟一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, it's about to get a little bit worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昆恩想用你受伤的录像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn wants to use the footage of you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！不行。对，她已经叫了救护车，正在路上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?! No. Yeah, she's got an ambulance on its way right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她要把你曝光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna out you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她基本上会说，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's basically gonna say that, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.02,0:25:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直对你的球队撒谎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you've been lying to your team this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会毁了我的职业生涯，我的体育解说工作，全部。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That'll kill my career, my sportscasting gig, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。媒体会铺天盖地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. The media is gonna be all over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会变成那种讨厌女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna be a guy that hates women
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.99,0:25:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还对自己的伤撒谎的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and lies about his injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.29,0:25:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你得把这事摆平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you got to make this go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.00,0:25:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在想办法，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm trying to,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我需要你百分之百配合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm gonna need you onboard, like, 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个医生，能给你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a doctor that will give you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.14,0:25:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他能给你打硬膜外麻醉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll give you an epidural.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.61,0:25:40.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}硬膜外麻醉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An epidural?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，它只是……它能阻断疼痛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it just... It'll just block the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道硬膜外麻醉是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know what an epidural is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我的医生说，我需要感受疼痛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But my doc says I need the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.81,0:25:47.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我可能会坐轮椅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise, I could end up in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.65,0:25:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，我不会让你陷入任何\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, I'm not gonna put you in any kind of situation
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.35,0:25:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能受伤的情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}where you can get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.65,0:25:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.89,0:25:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗密欧，我们谈过了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Romeo, we talked about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.16,0:25:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说不值得冒这个险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he says it's not worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:25:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说什么？他说不值得冒这个险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He says what? He says it's not worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每周拿命去冒险的人是他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he the one that's risking his life every week?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:03.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他一直支持我。一直都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he's always had my back. Always has.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.06,0:26:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说，如果你把这季录完，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying that if you finish the season,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.03,0:26:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是真正的明星了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're a bona fide star.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.77,0:26:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要问问自己，说到底，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just have to ask yourself at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.17,0:26:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.87,0:26:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么，D？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.27,0:26:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要养活很多人，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I support a lot of people, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.67,0:26:15.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.01,0:26:19.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗密欧说不用担心，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Romeo says not to worry about it, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.98,0:26:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连他也不用担心，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not even worry about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.25,0:26:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用担心我妈，我侄女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not to worry about my mom, my niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.82,0:26:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只管专注自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just to focus on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.28,0:26:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得自己对他们有责任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You feel responsible for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.36,0:26:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.69,0:26:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，去打硬膜外麻醉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, just get the epidural,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.13,0:26:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走出那扇门，挂上笑容。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you walk out that door, you put on a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.87,0:26:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救护车走了，你不在里面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The ambulance is gone, you're not in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.80,0:26:45.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈安全了，你侄女安全了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mom's safe, your niece is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生就在外面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The doctor's right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在就能解决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can fix this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.22,0:27:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.73,0:27:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，姑娘们，来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, ladies, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要我的姑娘们跟着我。你们跟着麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need my girls with me. You girls with Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.73,0:27:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！走吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quickly! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.86,0:27:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们可以从这里过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can maybe go through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.27,0:27:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们！快点。到这边来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies! Hurry it up. Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们，快点，快点，快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.17,0:27:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家好。嗨。猜猜怎么着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. Hi. Guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.97,0:27:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很快，达里乌斯就要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a short while, Darius is gonna be leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.71,0:27:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被担架抬去医院了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a stretcher for the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.11,0:27:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一个非常严重的情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, it is a very grave situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.41,0:27:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常严重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.88,0:27:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋说他没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel said he was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.75,0:27:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋根本不知道自己在说什么，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Rachel doesn't know what she's talking about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.85,0:27:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我知道。  -等等，他自己走到……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I do.   -Wait, he walks to the..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.72,0:27:33.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，有人在吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.99,0:27:35.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还站在这儿呢，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm still standing here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.89,0:27:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你们明白一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's what I need you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是担架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a stretcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.79,0:27:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里乌斯会躺在上面被送去医院，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius will be on it going to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.03,0:27:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这是你们的错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.40,0:27:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等。什么？  -是你们所有人害的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait. What?   -All of you did this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很痛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.13,0:27:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要眼泪，我要哭泣，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need tears, I need weeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要鼻涕从你们漂亮的脸蛋上流下来，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need snot running down your beautiful faces, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.07,0:27:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们会像小天使一样发光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll glow like cherubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.41,0:27:58.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:28:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像泰勒·斯威夫特问你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it's as if Taylor Swift, you know, asked you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.31,0:28:04.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不要加入她的姐妹团，然后又反悔了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be a part of her girl squad and then changed her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.45,0:28:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.29,0:28:11.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.37,0:28:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，他出来了。继续哭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, he's coming out. Keep up the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好了，谁哭得最凶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now listen, whoever cries the hardest
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.08,0:28:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就能陪达里厄斯去急诊室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gets to ride to the ER with Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.55,0:28:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？听清楚了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.95,0:28:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，走吧，丹。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's go, Dan. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.35,0:28:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好了，女士们。  -太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, all right, ladies.   -Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还是大师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are still the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.89,0:28:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。三、二、一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.29,0:28:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么没在担架上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is he not on the gur...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -他在走路？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -He's walking?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.87,0:28:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.94,0:29:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？为什么这么难过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up? Why so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.14,0:29:02.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -好吧，我糊涂了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Okay, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.01,0:29:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩说你伤得很重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn said you were really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.45,0:29:10.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，这不过是办公室的又一天，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, it was just another day at the office, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.55,0:29:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是受伤了，还能做这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I was hurt, could I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.29,0:29:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，接下来呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, so what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.39,0:29:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我想我本该要去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I think I was supposed to be going
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.29,0:29:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和某位幸运女士进行一对一的约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a one-on-one with some lucky lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……那就是我。是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's... that's me. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:27.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.90,0:29:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.04,0:29:34.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.21,0:29:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，这可真够可以的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.01,0:29:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么弄得这么粉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How'd you get it that pink?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.24,0:29:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是胃药而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just Pepto-Bismol.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.38,0:29:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给她灌的量都能淹死一匹马了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gave her enough to drown a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.88,0:29:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。太棒了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. It's fantastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们要用救护车，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and now we're gonna use the ambulance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.42,0:29:47.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她的病状弄得更严重，送她去医院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's up her sickness, take her to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.55,0:29:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫他们现在拉响警笛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So tell them to turn the sirens on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.46,0:29:50.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过，女士们。借过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, ladies. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.89,0:29:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续走就是了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.86,0:29:57.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她吐在我鞋上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She threw up on my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:58.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.93,0:30:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.33,0:30:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you actually doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:07.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兄弟，冷静点，好吗？冷静？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bro, calm down, okay? Calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到你扔那个球了。你连眉头都没皱一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you throw that ball. You didn't even wince.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.18,0:30:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋给我打了一针，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel gave me a shot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，她给我打了针。我能录完节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, she gave me a shot. I can finish the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:18.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会没事的。你并不确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be fine. You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.08,0:30:20.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你瘫痪了她会给你擦屁股吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think she's gonna wipe your ass when you're paralyzed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.49,0:30:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在康复中心流着口水过完接下来40年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drooling away the next 40 years of your life in some rehab joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，D。嗨。我们准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, D. Hi. We're actually ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们进度有点慢，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're moving a little slow, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.06,0:30:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去，瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here, Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松点，放松点，好吗？放松。完全没事。完全没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ease up, ease up, okay? Ease up. It's totally fine. It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你继续留在这个节目，就是在害死自己，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stay on this show, you're killing yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.93,0:30:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会参与其中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm not gonna be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.33,0:30:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的，D。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean it, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.67,0:30:37.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.04,0:30:40.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你可以走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.41,0:30:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你听见我说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.11,0:30:43.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经决定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.94,0:30:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你不能支持它，那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you can't support it, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.28,0:30:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就被解雇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.98,0:30:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在不可能是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't be serious right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去跟他说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为达里厄斯付出了我的生命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gave my life for Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.03,0:31:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.63,0:31:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道那是什么感觉吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have any idea what that's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当然不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.60,0:31:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚刚毒害了我们俩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just poisoned the best thing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拥有过的最好的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that either one of us ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.97,0:31:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就为了一个电视节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And for a television show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:19.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你得带着这件事活下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you have to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.14,0:31:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去跟上帝说吧，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You talk to God about that, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.12,0:31:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们小心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch your backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:36.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。开始。抬起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Here we go. Raising up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，很好，这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, great, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.37,0:31:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带她绕街区一圈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take her around the block
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.14,0:31:44.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为淘汰仪式需要她回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because we need her back here for the elimination ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.30,0:31:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，姑娘们，换回礼服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, girls, back in your gowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.71,0:31:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:52.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，女士们，进里面休息室补妆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, ladies, let's head inside to the green room for touch ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.04,0:31:53.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点。走，走，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick it up. Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.22,0:31:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抬起头。没什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chin up. It's not that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.72,0:32:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆森，快点。走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jameson, pick it up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.29,0:32:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:02.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全力出击拿下胜利，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hit it out for the win,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.49,0:32:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像你无所不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like there's nothing you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.29,0:32:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，切特。我们无所不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Chet. Nothing we can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.76,0:32:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在一起很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're good together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一起工作……并肩作战，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Working together... side by side,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.03,0:32:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我想起了过去的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it reminded me of the way things used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.07,0:32:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我遇见你那天就该离开辛西娅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I should've left Cynthia the day I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.30,0:32:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样大家都少受很多罪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would've saved everybody a lot of grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.11,0:32:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我一生的挚爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.54,0:32:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.28,0:32:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我希望你相信我，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I want you to trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.05,0:32:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我现在有孩子了，而且我……我变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I-I have a baby now, and I've... I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.25,0:32:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在有责任感了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm responsible now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.72,0:32:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们再试一次，如果我们再试一次，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we tried this again, if we tried it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.38,0:32:35.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会是一个全新的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it would be a whole new universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会是……会是你应得的那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would be... It'd be the one you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.36,0:32:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我们真要这么做，那会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we're gonna do this, it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.46,0:32:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我叫他们绕过街角，不是开进车道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I told them to go around the corner, not down the drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.23,0:32:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个全新的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a whole new universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁报的警？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, who called the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.17,0:32:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.07,0:32:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特·威尔顿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet Wilton?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.34,0:32:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。呃，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no. Uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.47,0:32:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情不是看起来那样。我保证……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't what it looks like. I assure you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.74,0:32:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你因绑架被捕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're under arrest for kidnapping
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.34,0:32:57.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有危害儿童安全。她会继续……好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and child endangerment. She's gonna keep... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.54,0:32:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认真的吗？这太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously? This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你偷了自己的孩子？不。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stole your kid? No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:03.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，那是我儿子，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, that's my son, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.08,0:33:04.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手放到背后。那是我儿子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get your hands behind your back. That's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.48,0:33:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！把手放到背后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她在干什么？  -退下，退下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What is she doing?   -Stand down, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.69,0:33:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我没……我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I'm not... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.49,0:33:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的每个字都是真心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant every word I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.56,0:33:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.62,0:33:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个字，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every word, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.76,0:33:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对我儿子做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing with my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.38,0:33:32.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》讲的是爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting" is about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但有时候，爱也关乎失去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But sometimes, love is about loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.65,0:33:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你们五个人离开，是件大事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Letting five of you go feels big.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.65,0:33:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像是一件事的结束\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like it's the end of one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.65,0:33:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和另一件事的开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the beginning of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.12,0:33:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我念到你的名字，就过来站到我身边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I call your name, come stand beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.46,0:33:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会一起继续这段旅程。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll continue this journey together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.79,0:33:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我没念到……那么，祝你们一切顺利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I don't... well, I wish you all the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:53.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}露比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.27,0:33:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}詹姆森。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jameson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.69,0:34:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beth Ann.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.73,0:34:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是最后一个了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.33,0:34:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.80,0:34:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.71,0:34:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我就是个笑话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I'm just a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.88,0:34:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝醉的穆斯林，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drunk Muslim, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.75,0:34:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以把这玩意儿塞进你的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can shove this up your
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！走，走，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟着好戏走！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Follow the drama! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.50,0:34:57.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:34:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，这就是派对卡车，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is the party truck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.50,0:35:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你找到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.60,0:35:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要给我点吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gonna give me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:15.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得瑞秋恨我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I think Rachel hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.65,0:35:19.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎加入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她为什么恨你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why does she hate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.56,0:35:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你们俩有过一段，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you two had a thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:30.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我们，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we're, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.66,0:35:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不会谈那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're not gonna talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.77,0:35:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她能让大家做那些事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's pretty amazing how she gets everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.57,0:35:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to do the things they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.74,0:35:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的还不到一半。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.51,0:35:45.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.38,0:35:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全部。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.42,0:35:57.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那需要我好好了解你才行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would require me getting to know you a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.26,0:36:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那样的话，你不如带我参观一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, in that case, why don't you give me a tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.26,0:36:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这卡车挺小的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a pretty small truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.00,0:36:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么可看的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not much to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.87,0:36:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的不是卡车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't talking about the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》讲的是爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting" is about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要来瓶啤酒吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是你朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.77,0:36:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.84,0:36:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我见识了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You showed me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来你没我也能做这节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess you can make this show without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.31,0:36:51.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，奎因，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Quinn,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.84,0:36:54.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我们在为工作的事吵架，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know we're fighting about work stuff, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.35,0:36:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}工作的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Work stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.65,0:37:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能有什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What other stuff is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.45,0:37:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.39,0:37:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.02,0:37:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且合作得不好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.46,0:37:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.33,0:37:11.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受够了我生活里那些垃圾人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm done with all the garbage people in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.06,0:37:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兰迪、切特，现在是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Randy, Chet, and now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.64,0:37:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.74,0:37:22.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一直打制作办公室的电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They keep calling the production office.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.04,0:37:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们想知道该怎么处理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They want to know what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲的遗物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with your father's personal effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.91,0:37:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把所有东西堆到房子里，扔根火柴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just put everything in the house, throw in a match,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.05,0:37:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}烧个精光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and burn it to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.06,0:37:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还真难找。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a hard man to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.63,0:37:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.76,0:37:47.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是问有没有摄像头跟着我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean are there cameras on my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.73,0:37:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，他们不跟拍我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, they don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:50.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是老婆人选。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a wifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能坐吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.72,0:38:05.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，罗密欧走了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Romeo left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.68,0:38:07.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.52,0:38:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我厌倦了别人对我指手画脚，所以我让他走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm tired of people telling me what to do, so I let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.06,0:38:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是家人，达里厄斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's family, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.82,0:38:15.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能就这么让他走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.53,0:38:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你这是怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.46,0:38:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，这里就我一个人，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, this is just me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.53,0:38:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟什么节目游戏没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not about some game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.97,0:38:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.94,0:38:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，我不喜欢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man, I don't like
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.45,0:38:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方把每个人都变成什么样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what this place is doing to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.42,0:38:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈的，我也不喜欢它把我变成什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, I don't like what it's doing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.08,0:38:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它把你变成什么样了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's it doing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.82,0:38:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我太在意别人的看法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Making me care too much about what other people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.95,0:38:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.69,0:38:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.03,0:38:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那倒没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.10,0:38:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的很坚强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:38:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，别误会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.84,0:39:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你嘴巴是挺厉害的，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you got a mouth on you and all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.41,0:39:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘴巴厉害。行吧，老奶奶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A mouth. Okay, grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一辈子都在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spent my entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.78,0:39:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让别人替我拿主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}letting other people make decisions for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.62,0:39:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再这样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.55,0:39:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该做回我自己了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time I be my own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做自己想做的事，感觉真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It just feels good to do something I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.00,0:39:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪怕就一次不用担惊受怕，去冒一次险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to worry for once, to take a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.63,0:39:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，我就想成为那样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, that's the guy I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.47,0:39:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就去做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.47,0:39:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成为那样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.93,0:39:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定这就是那个人想要的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure this is what that guy wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.83,0:40:00.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这正是那个人想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is exactly what that guy wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.26,0:40:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沃瑟曼，你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wasserman, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.93,0:40:31.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.06,0:40:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来瓶啤酒吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Want a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.67,0:40:36.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想，我很乐意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I'd love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.00,0:40:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.00,0:40:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请给我吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.11,0:40:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.82,0:40:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要这么做吗，沃瑟曼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we doing this, Wasserman?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.08,0:40:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 等了这么久终于来了 ＊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* It's been a long time coming down *
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:40:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 你肯定以为我永远不会回头 ＊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Bet you thought I'd never come around *
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.59,0:41:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 伴着这声音，可我来了 ＊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* With this sound, but I did *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.23,0:41:04.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 拉把椅子坐下，该你上场了 ＊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull up a chair, it's time to get yours *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.13,0:41:06.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 拿下，拿下，拿下你的，宝贝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Get, get, get yours, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.16,0:41:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 拉把椅子坐下，该你上场了 ＊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull up a chair, it's time to get yours *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.80,0:41:11.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}＊ 耶，耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Yeah, yeah
